<para>Pointer to the <ref refid="struct_x_asu___slhdsa_sign_verify_params" kindref="compound">XAsu_SlhdsaSignVerifyParams</ref> structure which holds the SLH-DSA signature verification parameters.</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>XST_SUCCESS, if IPI request to ASU is sent successfully.</para></listitem><listitem><para>XASU_INVALID_ARGUMENT, if any argument is invalid.</para></listitem><listitem><para>XASU_INVALID_UNIQUE_ID, if the unique ID is invalid.</para></listitem><listitem><para>XST_FAILURE, if sending an IPI request to ASU fails.</para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para></simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Success here only means the request was queued; the verdict arrives as XASU_SLHDSA_SIGNATURE_VERIFIED in AdditionalStatus via the callback. CtxLen and CtxAddr must match the values used when the signature was created. </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
