    <briefdescription>
<para>This file contains the implementation of the client interface functions for the SLH-DSA (FIPS 205) module. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each API validates the client-supplied parameters, registers a completion callback, builds the command header and forwards the request to ASUFW over IPI.</para><para>Key pair generation is not an SLH-DSA module command: it is requested through the key manager, using XAsu_KmGenerateSlhdsaKeyPair. All 64-bit addresses in the parameter structures must point to memory visible to both the client and ASUFW, and those buffers must remain valid until the registered callback reports completion.</para><para><preformatted>
MODIFICATION HISTORY:</preformatted></para><para><preformatted>Ver   Who  Date     Changes
<hruler/>

1.0   kk   07/10/26 Initial release</preformatted></para><para><preformatted></preformatted> </para>    </detaileddescription>
